 "key_insight": "The Royal Kennel Club wins 'kc registered staffy puppies' and the UK for-sale search on registry authority, yet its puppy listing sits behind a sign-in wall, its 495-URL map has no Staffordshire Bull Terrier page, and its buyer advice (questions to ask a breeder) is written for every breed. BSUK can meet the same buyer with a Staffy-specific version of that checklist, answered on the page with its own health tests, registration papers and visible litters, no login needed."
